# Synapse Architecture Lexicon & Public Clean-Room Governance

1. **Read First:** Before modifying any code, read `AGENTS.md`, `memory/PROJECT_STATE.md`, `memory/BLACKBOX.md`, and `memory/MILESTONES.md`.
2. **Strict Modularization & Coverage:** Keep every `.go` file `< 500` lines, every `.ts`/`.tsx` file `< 600` lines, `0` `any` types, `>= 85%` Go coverage, and `>= 90%` TS coverage.
3. **Public Clean-Room Policy:** Never commit secrets, private keys, hardcoded `/home/<user>` paths, or private server IPs.
4. **Write Back:** Update `memory/PROJECT_STATE.md`, `memory/MILESTONES.md`, and `memory/BLACKBOX.md` (`[BB-XXX]`) after every completed feature or release.
